{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00390","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 十一 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"礼终肆类，乐阕九成。\n仰惟明德，敢荐非馨。\n顾慙菲奠，久驻云軿。\n瞻荷灵泽，悚恋兼盈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00390.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00390","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}